---
Personal API tokens: hat_ reads and writes, hrt_ only reads. A new token is
shown once.

Usage: hn tokens [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  list    List your API tokens (never the token itself)
  create  Create a token and show it once
  revoke  Revoke a token

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

Global options:
  -p, --profile <NAME>  Profile to use (server and login), see 'hn profile list'
      --json            Print JSON instead of tables (stable shape, for scripts)

Examples:
  hn tokens
  hn tokens create "Home Assistant"
  hn tokens create ci --read
  hn tokens revoke <id>
